            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/LibrarianFitzhume_EMP_03.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1346371,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC10_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Done? Congratulations, blah blah. While we're on the subject of thoroughness, I hear you failed to submit your full post-Mirage report.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/LibrarianFitzhume_EMP_04.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1346371,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC10_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Whatever you did in Mirage managed to pull several of the Scholars' noses out of their books and get them all worked up about something.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/LibrarianFitzhume_EMP_05.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1346371,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC10_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Old Baba Yaga's been ranting and raving even more than usual. I think she's even been crying. Hehe. Yes, you should probably check on her.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/LibrarianFitzhume_EMP_06.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1346371,
